[{"answer":"Today I'd like to introduce Ted Hunter,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/1.mp3"},{"answer":"who used to rear sheep and poultry","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/2.mp3"},{"answer":"but who is here to tell us about a rather unusual type of livestock","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/3.mp3"},{"answer":"that he's been concentrating on in the last few years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Ted Hunter is a member of the Domesticated Ostrich Farming Association,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and is here to tell us about the possibilities of breeding and rearing these birds in this country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, Paula.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/7.mp3"},{"answer":"When you look at international restaurant menus and supermarkets,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/8.mp3"},{"answer":"they all tend to feature the same range of meats -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/9.mp3"},{"answer":"beef, lamb, chicken, pork, that sort of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/10.mp3"},{"answer":"But people are always interested in something different","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and we're now finding that farming can bring new types of meat to our tables.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The kangaroo is one animal that's now being farmed for its meat","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and eaten outside Australia, where it comes from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It looks and tastes rather like rabbit,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/15.mp3"},{"answer":"though it's slightly darker in colour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but it is rather tough, so that's a problem for some people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Crocodiles are also being farmed for their meat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/18.mp3"},{"answer":"This is rather like chicken,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/19.mp3"},{"answer":"pale and tender, and it's getting quite fashionable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people also find it's rather fatty, but","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it makes a really tasty sandwich.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Now a third type of meat becoming increasingly available,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and the one that I think is by far the nicest of the three, is ostrich,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/24.mp3"},{"answer":"which most people say has a similar taste and texture to beef.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/25.mp3"},{"answer":"However, it's much better for you than beef, as we'll see later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people think of ostriches as wild animals,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/27.mp3"},{"answer":"but in fact ostriches have been farmed in South Africa since around 1860.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/28.mp3"},{"answer":"At first they were produced for their feathers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/29.mp3"},{"answer":"In Africa they were used for tribal ceremonial dress","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and they were also exported to Europe and America","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/31.mp3"},{"answer":"where they were made into ladies' fans and used for decorating hats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Later, feather fans and big, decorated hats went out of fashion","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/33.mp3"},{"answer":"but ostriches were still bred,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/34.mp3"},{"answer":"this time for their hide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/35.mp3"},{"answer":"This can be treated to produce about half a square metre of leather -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/36.mp3"},{"answer":"very delicate, fine stuff of very good quality.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/37.mp3"},{"answer":"At the same time, some of the meat was used for biltong -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/38.mp3"},{"answer":"the air-dried strips of meat popular in South Africa as a sort of fast food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/39.mp3"},{"answer":"However, recently there's been more and more interest in the development of ostrich farming in other parts of the world,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and more people are recognising its value as a food source.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Ostrich meat is slightly higher in protein than beef -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and much lower in fats and cholesterol.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It tastes good too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/44.mp3"},{"answer":"A series of European taste tests","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/45.mp3"},{"answer":"found that 82% of people prefer ostrich to beef.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And one ostrich produces a lot of meat -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/47.mp3"},{"answer":"from around 30 to 50 kg mostly from the hindquarters of the bird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Farmed ostriches don't need African climates,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and in fact ostrich farming is now becoming well established in other parts of the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/50.mp3"},{"answer":"However, setting up an ostrich farm isn't something to embark on lightly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Mature breeding birds are very expensive -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/52.mp3"},{"answer":"even a fertilised ostrich egg isn't cheap","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/53.mp3"},{"answer":"so you need quite a bit of capital to begin with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the farmer needs special equipment such as incubators for the eggs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The young chicks are very dependent on human minders,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and need a lot of attention from the people looking after them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/57.mp3"},{"answer":"In addition, ostriches can't be intensively farmed -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/58.mp3"},{"answer":"they need space and exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/59.mp3"},{"answer":"But in spite of this, they make good farming sense.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/60.mp3"},{"answer":"A cow produces only one calf a year","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/61.mp3"},{"answer":"whereas a female ostrich can lay an egg every other day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And because the farmers can use incubators and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/63.mp3"},{"answer":"hatched chicks are nourished well and protected from danger,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/64.mp3"},{"answer":"the failure rate on farms is very low indeed","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and almost all the fertilised eggs will hatch out into chicks","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/66.mp3"},{"answer":"which will in turn reach maturity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/67.mp3"},{"answer":"This is very different from the situation in the wild,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/68.mp3"},{"answer":"where the vast majority of chicks will die or be killed","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/69.mp3"},{"answer":"before they grow up into mature ostriches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/70.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's possible, once the initial outlay has been made,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/71.mp3"},{"answer":"for the farmer to be looking at very good profit margins indeed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Ostrich farming is still in its early days outside Africa","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/73.mp3"},{"answer":"but we hope that ostrich meat will be freely available soon","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and before long will be as cheap as beef.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-4-2023-08-16-18-13-00/75.mp3"}]
